{"4836720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doom & Bloom", "steam_appid": 4836720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4975330], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>wizard-turned-gardener</strong>, tasked with with protecting <strong>magical gardens</strong> spread across multiple biomes. Each garden is managed by a living magical structure, the <strong>Heartvine</strong>, which will give you tasks to complete. Complete the tasks and ensure the Heartvine survives long enough to permanently <strong>enchant the biome and protect its garden</strong>.<br><br>As magical bugs attack the Heartvine and eat your crops, there is only one way to fight the enchanted creatures: shrink down to their size and engage in <strong>hand-to-hand combat</strong>! Fight with a <strong>sword</strong>, <strong>fling spells</strong> to defeat them, and grow <strong>defensive plants</strong> to fight back against the bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer mail, purchase items in the shop, and sell your crops to make a profit and expand your farm! You start in the classic farming <i><strong>plains biome</strong></i>, and over time you can expand into the <i><strong>fae forest, dwarven caverns, and more biomes</strong></i>.<br><br>Upcoming updates include decorating your home, brewing potions, and exploring bug-infested caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doom and Bloom</strong> is a real-time, single-player farming–exploration game with light action, strategic planning, and systemic pressure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>wizard-turned-gardener</strong>, tasked with with protecting <strong>magical gardens</strong> spread across multiple biomes. Each garden is managed by a living magical structure, the <strong>Heartvine</strong>, which will give you tasks to complete. Complete the tasks and